        "<br>",
        "<br>",
        "<h2>The Monologue of Brainwaves</h2>",
        "<p>Rong Art Centre, Shanghai, 2026</p>",
        "<p>What would the 'shapes' of emotions be like? In an experimental creating & curating workshop combining neuroscience with contemporary art, high school students collaborate with instructors to record brainwave signals using EEG sensor. Through creative hardware & software engineering, the invisible and ineffable inner fluctuations are captured and translated into media paintings, kinetic installations and interactive videos -- a miniature 'merry-go-round' driven by memories, an underwater 'vortex' sparked by moods, an onscreen 'flower' blossoming with emotions...therefore forming an exhibition that audiences can experience, sense and become part of.</p>",
        "<br>",

